  "volumes": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "volumeKey": "text",
      "label": "Text",
      "document": {
        "version": 1,
        "blocks": [
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [],
            "id": "p-882a20e6379eb83a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Part location] Leg"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Version] Seventh revision"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Revisions made]"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. In order to ensure structural stability, additional giant gears have been added, serial numbers: ███ and ████. For further details, see the attachment to the bottom right."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. The water pipe that was originally used for water cooling has been removed and changed to steam absorption for heat dissipation, with a waste gas exhaust pipe added to the top of the original component. The connection method is still to be discussed."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "3. Two Geomarrow motors have been added to ensure power, located in the base of the component."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "[Future improvements]"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "1. In order to ensure that this component will not damage the power core while running, a protective cover is scheduled to be added to the Geomarrow motor. The Logistics Department will need to purchase this."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "2. We estimate that more Geomarrow engines will need to be added in order to offset the extra weight caused by the protective cover."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-683821b46e8a6088"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "em",
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "text": "Various suggestions from others have been posted around the frame."
                  }
                ]
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-04fbbd0e144b7163"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Suggestion: Could the gears be too large?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Reply: Large is good."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Suggestion: Maybe there are too many gears?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Reply: More gears look better."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-40a261f4dbe6abc6"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Suggestion: Would the exhaust pipe obstruct movement?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Reply: I don't think so."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-aa26deec24a04265"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Suggestion: This thing doesn't look like a leg, it looks more like a chimney. Can its \"knees\" even bend?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Reply: We'll add that later."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-e216d57a1c33169a"
          },
          {
            "type": "paragraph",
            "children": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Suggestion: Have you considered taking up mining instead?"
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Reply: Not at the moment."
              },
              {
                "type": "br"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Suggestion (additional): No need for consideration, someone is taking over your project tomorrow. Go and familiarize yourself with mining machinery."
              }
            ],
            "id": "p-86e0fafeeb45523c"
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
